INSERT INTO feature VALUES('unbiased-composition','identity','Unbiased composition (compose[n, k])','univalence-per-stratum','implemented','unique','dependent provers','`compose[n, k](chain(m), (c₁, …, cₘ))` composes a chain of paths at a stratum the chain sub-site certifies: the chain is read as a shape of that stratum, and the cells are checked to meet end to end by conversion. The node carries the left-nested `Path.step` fold of its cells, which evaluation runs and the kernel replays as it replays the chain written with `Path.step`, so a composite of decided cells reduces. Every nesting of a chain converts with that fold: a transport along a stuck composite moves its operand along each of the composite''s paths in turn, in evaluation and in the kernel''s replay. `compose[n, k](chain(m, (a₁, …, aₘ)), cells)` composes the level-two shape `[m](a₁, …, aₘ)` of 2-cells at a stratum level two certifies: each column folds vertically by `Path.step`, and the columns fold horizontally by the whiskers the filler generator lifts by, so the whisker `[2](1, 0)` is the right whisker. At reflexivities a whisker runs to reflexivity before a composite reads it, in evaluation and in the kernel''s replay. The node holds its shape as one Batanin tree at the level of its cells: `chain(m)` is the tree `[m]` at level one, and `chain(m, (a₁, …, aₘ))` the tree `[m](a₁, …, aₘ)` at level two. A stratum the chains do not certify, one past the chain budget among them, a shape past its stratum, a tree past level two and cells that do not fill it are refused by name, a fill defect at its seam. A 1-cell in a column of 2-cells is refused at that column by the profile of its vertex. `Path.step(p, q)` lowers to the composite of its 2-chain at the least stratum, `compose[3, 5]`. The printer and the formatter write the form back as it is written, and that composite as `Path.step(p, q)`.','core-term core-checker core-nbe kernel-core surface-lowering surface-pretty surface-format theory-sites','corpus/model/identity/compose-chain.gandr corpus/model/identity/composite-nestings.gandr corpus/model/identity/then.gandr corpus/model/identity/walk-over-fillers.gandr corpus/ledger/diagnostics/ComposeUncertified.gandr corpus/ledger/diagnostics/ComposeNotAShape.gandr corpus/ledger/diagnostics/ComposeDoesNotFill.gandr','corpus/ledger/features/unbiased-composition.gandr',NULL);
